# out/ - the built partition kit (HAL binary, effect library, XMLs, apply.sh, flashable zip) - IS tracked, so
# every commit carries the exact kit built from it. See .gitattributes: it is stored byte-for-byte.
# Extracted device files, APKs and decompilations (5+ GB) - kept local
work/
# Compiled artefacts of the helper tools (rebuilt from their sources)
tools/**/out/
tools/**/classes/
*.class
*.dex
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Superseded partial installers and intermediate builds stay local.
# The consolidated, approved kit is tracked in out/coloros_release/.
/out/coloros/
/out/CTS_hold_enable/
/out/CTS_hold_enable.zip
/out/ColorOS_haptic_sync_fix/
/out/ColorOS_haptic_sync_fix*.zip
/out/ColorOS_message_tone_sync/
/out/ColorOS_message_tone_sync.zip
